'''Golurk''' (Japanese: '''ゴルーグ''' ''Goloog'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion.

