==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BW-P Promo|Golurk|46}}, one of the {{TCG|BW-P Promotional cards}} released only in Japan.
*'''Double Lariat''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Neo Discovery|Ursaring|15}} from the {{TCG|Neo Discovery}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

